"# LLM Tool → Autonomous Move
Consumes the adapter_to_link Control event autonomy.move_to.

This graph only submits RequestedTarget and then commits RequestSerial. Autonomy Controller remains the policy owner:
- accepts requests only while autonomy is enabled, ActMode is FREE, no Interaction owns the character, and no FREE exit is pending;
- clamps the target to DESKTOP_SOFT_BOUNDS;
- delegates actual movement to the existing Locomotion request seam.

Control admission is not movement completion. Do not add direct Character transform writes here.

Business result v1:
- event.accepted remains transport admission only;
- after Locomotion.Arrived becomes true, AcceptedRequestSerial must still match this tool request;
- then autonomy.move_to.result is sent with reply_to = original EventId, status = completed and actual position;
- policy rejection, supersession and interruption are not guessed as completion; Adapter result timeout remains execution_unknown."
